Z||000010||Oreif||06-17-2000||12:45 AM||||The "GTU" version is the base coupe body. The "GTO" version is a fastback GT.<BR>The SE version was raced under GTU also.<BR>GTU/GTO is an IMSA classification.<BR>GTU = under 3.0L<BR>GTO = Over 3.0L<BR>The GTU cars ran 2.7L SD4 engines and the GTO cars ran a 3.4L hopped up V-6.||||reg||1
